      "marker": null,
      "zh": "发明名称: 环磺酮的制备方法和中间体",
      "en": "Title of invention: Preparation method and intermediates of tembotrione",
      "notes": "Centred title line. 环磺酮 is the Chinese common name of the triketone herbicide tembotrione; translated by common name."
    },
    {
      "marker": null,
      "zh": "技术领域",
      "en": "Technical field",
      "notes": "Section heading."
    },
    {
      "marker": "[0001]",
      "zh": "本发明涉及用于制备除草剂环磺酮的新方法和新中间体化合物。",
      "en": "The present invention relates to a new process for preparing the herbicide tembotrione and to new intermediate compounds.",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "marker": null,
      "zh": "背景技术",
      "en": "Background art",
      "notes": "Section heading."
    },
    {
      "marker": "[0002]",
      "zh": "环磺酮是一种三酮类除草剂，具有高效、低毒、残留少、广谱等优点，因此自上市以来市场日益扩大。",
      "en": "Tembotrione is a triketone herbicide having the advantages of high efficacy, low toxicity, low residue and a broad spectrum, and its market has therefore expanded steadily since launch.",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "marker": "[0003]",
      "zh": "作为环磺酮的制备方法，原研专利文献DE19846792A1公开了如下方法：",
      "en": "As a process for preparing tembotrione, the originator patent document DE19846792A1 discloses the following process:",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "marker": "[0004]",
      "zh": "上述方法中所用的原料二氯甲苯在反应时选择性不好，导致杂质多，收率低。",
      "en": "The dichlorotoluene starting material used in the above process has poor selectivity in the reaction, leading to many impurities and a low yield.",
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "marker": "[0005]",
      "zh": "目前广泛报道和采用的是如下路线(参见例如200510030163.5号中国专利申请)：",
      "en": "The route widely reported and used at present is the following (see, for example, Chinese patent application No. 200510030163.5):",
      "notes": "The scheme this sentence introduces is not on this page; it continues on the next page."
    }
